ata-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Find sources AFD\",\"href\":\"./Template:Find_sources_AFD\"},\"params\":{\"title\":{\"wt\":\"5 September 2016 Syria bombings\"}},\"i\":0}}]}' id=\"mwFg\"><i>Find sources:</i><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span><a rel=\"mw:ExtLink nofollow\" href=\"https://www.google.com/search?as_eq=wikipedia&amp;q=%225+September+2016+Syria+bombings%22\" class=\"external text\">Google</a> (<a rel=\"mw:ExtLink nofollow\" href=\"https://www.google.com/search?tbs=bks:1&amp;q=%225+September+2016+Syria+bombings%22+-wikipedia\" class=\"external text\">books</a> <b>·</b> <a rel=\"mw:ExtLink nofollow\" href=\"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=nws&amp;q=%225+September+2016+Syria+bombings%22+-wikipedia&amp;tbs=ar:1\" class=\"external text\">news</a> <b>·</b> <a rel=\"mw:ExtLink nofollow\" href=\"https://scholar.google.com/scholar?q=%225+September+2016+Syria+bombings%22\" class=\"external text\">scholar</a> <b>·</b> <a rel=\"mw:ExtLink nofollow\" href=\"https://www.google.com/search?safe=off&amp;tbs=sur:fmc&amp;tbm=isch&amp;q=%225+September+2016+Syria+bombings%22+-site:wikipedia.org+-site:wikimedia.org\" class=\"external text\">free images</a> <b>·</b> <a rel=\"mw:ExtLink nofollow\" href=\"https://www.google.com/custom?hl=en&amp;cx=007734830908295939403%3Agalkqgoksq0&amp;cof=FORID%3A13%3BAH%3Aleft%3BCX%3AWikipedia%2520Reference%2520Search&amp;q=%225+September+2016+Syria+bombings%22\" class=\"external text\">WP<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span>refs</a>) <b>·</b> <span title=\"Free English newspaper sources\" style=\"border-bottom: 1px dotted;\"><a rel=\"mw:ExtLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Free_English_newspaper_sources\" class=\"external text\">FENS</a></span> <b>·</b> <a rel=\"mw:ExtLink nofollow\" href=\"https://www.jstor.org/action/doBasicSearch?Query=%225+September+2016+Syria+bombings%22&amp;acc=on&amp;wc=on\" class=\"external text\">JSTOR</a> <b>·</b> <span title=\"The Wikipedia Library\" style=\"border-bottom: 1px dotted;\"><a rel=\"mw:ExtLink nofollow\" href=\"https://wikipedialibrary.wmflabs.org/search/?q=%225+September+2016+Syria+bombings%22\" class=\"external text\">TWL</a></span></span>)</dd></dl>\n<p id=\"mwFw\">I propose <b id=\"mwGA\">merging</b> to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./List_of_terrorist_incidents_linked_to_the_Islamic_State\" title=\"List of terrorist incidents linked to the Islamic State\" id=\"mwGQ\">List of terrorist incidents linked to the Islamic State</a> and <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./List_of_terrorist_incidents_in_Syria\" title=\"List of terrorist incidents in Syria\" id=\"mwGg\">List of terrorist incidents in Syria</a> because this fails <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Wikipedia:NEVENT\" title=\"Wikipedia:NEVENT\" class=\"mw-redirect\" id=\"mwGw\">WP:NEVENT</a>, specifically <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Wikipedia:PERSISTENCE\" title=\"Wikipedia:PERSISTENCE\" class=\"mw-redirect\" id=\"mwHA\">WP:PERSISTENCE</a>. It also fails <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./Wikipedia:NOPAGE\" title=\"Wikipedia:NOPAGE\" class=\"mw-redirect\" id=\"mwHQ\">WP:NOPAGE</a>, and since there isn't any scholarly or news analysis of the event itself, it is better to put it in a list. Many of the news articles that can be found, if not all, just duplicate each other to a large extent. Good lists are supposed to give information of the things they collect, so it would be more encyclopedic if they were merged. It should not be deleted since it is sourced information, which while not notable, is due for inclusion in the list pages I suggested <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./User:HerrHeulsuse\" title=\"User:HerrHeulsuse\" id=\"mwHg\">HerrHeulsuse</a> (<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./User_talk:HerrHeulsuse\" title=\"User talk:HerrHeulsuse\" id=\"mwHw\">talk</a>) 08:02, 26 July 2026 (UTC)</p>"}],"html":"<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"./5_September_2016_Syria_bombings\" title=\"5 September 2016 Syria bombings\" id=\"mwAw\">5 September 2016 Syria bombings</a>","commentCount":8,"authorCount":7,"latestReplyTimestamp":"2026-08-02T20:56:00Z"}]}}